  // that exact outcome: { formatted: '0', raw: 0, symbol: 'RWAD' }, the same documented-fallback
  // contract as hydrateIceConfig below. The bridge returns that value verbatim; the transpiled
  // handler then runs its REAL logic on it (Math.max/toFixed/cache write). The JS function never
  // rejects, so no __chtAsyncError is set. Device-host generation implements the real
