  // property setter — same imperative-ref shape as .play()/.pause() above). S3 of
  // video-seek-scrub-blueprint.md §S6: 0 JSX producer as of this change (the drag-handle
  // JSX itself lives in the UniMaker React tree, out of this repo's shadow-tree scope) —
