    // lookup) is a cross-component first-match for it — measured miscompile: `() => v(!1)`
    // compiled to a global boolean-validator `v__bool` instead of the component's own useState
    // setter. Until owner-keyed slot/setter codegen exists, an owner-captured name resolves
